1
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:11,290
[2 years later]

2
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,510
Stay away from this stuff
after you get out.

3
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:22,440
Live a good life.

4
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,230
Go.

5
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:41,270
Welcome home.

6
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,920
You asked me to keep this for you.

7
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:53,240
Now it's returned to its rightful owner.

8
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,170
Congratulations on your new life.

9
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:56,780
These 2 rings

10
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:59,340
were meant to belong to you.

11
00:01:54,229 --> 00:01:55,400
Hello, Boss.

12
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:01,210
This place

13
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:04,640
is the deepest night of this city

14
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:07,370
and its most complicated corner.

15
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:15,310
But from now on,

16
00:02:15,750 --> 00:02:18,030
this place will be different.

17
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,630
It is a place

18
00:02:21,079 --> 00:02:24,079
where people who walk in
can forget their troubles.

19
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,079
A place for peace.

20
00:02:28,810 --> 00:02:31,280
And I want to give it to you.

21
00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:34,920
I have always been a pessimist.

22
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,329
[Dearest Episode 24]

23
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,110
If one day I get sick

24
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,960
or have an accident,

25
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:44,120
it can take my place

26
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,110
to back you up,

27
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,360
be your confidence,

28
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:51,710
and be your stepping stone.

29
00:04:03,790 --> 00:04:04,630
Ms. Wen.

30
00:04:05,690 --> 00:04:06,990
How have you been?

31
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,800
Envoy Yin.

32
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,120
Nope.

33
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:18,430
I should call you Commander Yin now.

34
00:04:19,589 --> 00:04:21,250
I'm here to congratulate you.

35
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:24,950
You really saved Wen Group
all by yourself.

36
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:31,100
My mother traded her life for it.

37
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,690
I must protect it.

38
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,680
I have to go.

39
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,560
Where are you going?

40
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:45,850
I've been specially assigned
to be stationed in Nansha.

41
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:50,830
I won't have many chances
to return to Xinggang.

42
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,430
It's nice to meet you, Wen Jianan.

43
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,000
Well,

44
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,060
I hope to see you again.

45
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,930
Remember to find me next time
you come back.

46
00:05:06,930 --> 00:05:09,050
Not as a special envoy or commander,

47
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,200
nor as an ally or partner,

48
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,000
but

49
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,000
as a friend.

50
00:05:22,770 --> 00:05:24,140
The sun is out.

51
00:05:29,670 --> 00:05:31,110
You tied your hair up.

52
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,480
What's wrong?

53
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:36,430
Does it look bad?

54
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,240
You look better than

55
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:44,090
any time I've seen you before.

56
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,920
Ms. Wen.

57
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,430
You've been working for so long,

58
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:10,680
staring at a cold computer.

59
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:12,560
Shouldn't you

60
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,560
take a break?

61
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:20,660
Men really are stumbling blocks on
a woman's path to success.

62
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:22,460
No matter how important work is,

63
00:06:22,630 --> 00:06:24,360
your health is also important.

64
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:26,350
Just a little.

65
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,540
Just a little more.

66
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:30,850
You said the same thing 2 hours ago.

67
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,090
But if this project loses money,

68
00:06:33,710 --> 00:06:36,040
you have to compensate me for everything.

69
00:06:54,390 --> 00:06:58,810
♪ In the darkness
where there is no light ♪

70
00:06:57,470 --> 00:06:59,730
Why do you keep looking at me? Don't look.

71
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:05,860
♪ At the end of every lonely night ♪

72
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,240
Didn't you say it at the nursing home?

73
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:05,120
In TV dramas,

74
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:07,000
that's how they do it.

75
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:12,820
♪ Now my heart is beating once again ♪

76
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:11,800
Taking off glasses means a kiss.

77
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:19,510
♪ Finally I'm breathing past the pain ♪

78
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:24,410
♪ In the winter breeze,
I feel your breath ♪

79
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:28,130
♪ Waking up my soul from frozen death ♪

80
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:28,810
Jiang Yu, let's have a wedding.

81
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:35,370
♪ Like a miracle, you came in view ♪

82
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,680
Just the two of us.

83
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:41,980
♪ At the edge of this breaking world ♪

84
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:46,220
♪ You are the only one
who brought the light ♪

85
00:07:46,670 --> 00:07:49,370
♪ Because it's you ♪

86
00:07:49,420 --> 00:07:50,920
♪ All my sorrows ♪

87
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:56,140
♪ Fading out of sight ♪

88
00:07:56,180 --> 00:08:02,340
♪ In your arms, I'm born again and new ♪

89
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:08,900
♪ Holding tightly to my hands and scars ♪

90
00:08:10,290 --> 00:08:12,720
♪ Your deep breathing ♪

91
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,630
Getting married!

92
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:16,730
♪ Guided like the stars ♪

93
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,190
Ms. Wen Jianan.

94
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,560
Mr. Jiang Yu.

95
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:19,310
Do you take Mr. Jiang Yu
to be your husband?

96
00:08:16,970 --> 00:08:24,170
♪ Now I'll never let you go ♪

97
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:22,430
Do you take Ms. Wen Jianan
to be your wife?

98
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:30,840
♪ At the edge of this breaking world ♪

99
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:28,950
In sickness and in health.

100
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:32,030
For richer, for poorer.

101
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:35,080
♪ You are the only one
who brought the light ♪

102
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:33,289
For better, for worse.

103
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:36,669
To love, cherish, and spoil her.

104
00:08:35,530 --> 00:08:38,230
♪ Because it's you ♪

105
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,200
To cherish and love him.

106
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,270
Buy her bags and houses.

107
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,780
♪ All my sorrows ♪

108
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:45,000
♪ Fading out of sight ♪

109
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:42,080
Until death do you part?

110
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,840
I do.

111
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,840
I do.

112
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:52,000
♪ In your arms, I'm born again and new ♪

113
00:08:52,890 --> 00:08:55,860
♪ All the cruel darkness fades away ♪

114
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:59,660
♪ And you bring the colors of the day ♪

115
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:08,880
♪ I will stay by your side ever-more ♪

116
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:19,280
♪ The only one who brought me through ♪

117
00:09:21,830 --> 00:09:31,620
♪ Because it's you ♪

118
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,330
Mr. Jiang Yu,

119
00:09:39,710 --> 00:09:43,950
do you take Ms. Wen Jianan
to be your wife?

120
00:09:47,430 --> 00:09:49,960
For richer, for poorer,

121
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,720
in sickness and in health,

122
00:09:55,630 --> 00:09:57,440
for better, for worse,

123
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:04,840
will you love and cherish her forever,

124
00:10:06,630 --> 00:10:10,550
until death do you part?

125
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,200
I do.

126
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,440
Ms. Wen Jianan,

127
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,080
do you take

128
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,630
Mr. Jiang Yu to be your husband?

129
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:36,040
For better, for worse,

130
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:37,960
for richer, for poorer,

131
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:40,640
in sickness and in health,

132
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:45,200
will you love and cherish him,

133
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:49,490
until death do you part?

134
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,750
I do.

135
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:49,820
Wen Jianan.

136
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,240
From now on,

137
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:57,240
I am all yours.

138
00:11:58,400 --> 00:12:00,720
We've come a long way to get here.

139
00:12:03,050 --> 00:12:05,130
No one cherishes this more than I do.

140
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:07,910
I promise.

141
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:11,110
No more evil

142
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,270
will tear us apart.

143
00:12:16,490 --> 00:12:18,370
We will never be apart again.

144
00:12:26,410 --> 00:12:30,830
♪ In the darkness
where there is no light ♪

145
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:37,880
♪ At the end of every lonely night ♪

146
